# The App Store page's list (System settings → App Store): one GitHub repo with a release zip per line,
# "owner/repo Name", the name optional. Lines under [Games] are on its Games tab, the rest on Apps;
# older firmware skips the [Games] line and lists them all. The device fetches this file; see
# docs/internals.md#q2-shelf.
# Firmware before the tabs (1.8.7 and older) reads only the first 16 apps, so the games, last, are the first left out.
DiamondBond/q2-rockbox Rockbox
DiamondBond/q2-rockbox-themes Rockbox Themes
DiamondBond/q2-librespot Spotify
group-a-study/q2-deezer Deezer
group-a-study/q2-soulseek Soulseek
group-a-study/q2-filebrowser File Browser
andsuor/q2-subsonic Subsonic
m-d-e-v/q2-podcasts Podcasts
harpmudd/q2-lma Live Music Archive
# group-a-study/q2-applemusic Apple Music
group-a-study/q2-airplay AirPlay
lampsonlnguyen/q2-utilities-app Utilities
[Games]
DiamondBond/q2-fidget Buddy
DiamondBond/q2-groovebox Groovebox
lampsonlnguyen/q2-arcade Additional Arcade Games
lampsonlnguyen/q2-2048 2048
lampsonlnguyen/q2-dino-runner Dino Runner
lampsonlnguyen/q2-flappybird Flappy Bird
lampsonlnguyen/q2-simon-says
# lampsonlnguyen/q2-arcade Q2 Arcade
